  "description": "本地模型识别论文章节结构：右键提取目录（带页码链接），不联网；给智能体按章节读论文的工具。",
  "author": "Gao Shoupeng",
  "icons": {
    "48": "content/icon.svg",
    "96": "content/icon.svg"
  },
  "applications": {
    "zotero": {
      "id": "paper-structure@wku.edu.cn",
      "update_url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/science223/plain-text-section-tools/main/zotero-plugin/updates.json",
      "strict_min_version": "6.999",
      "strict_max_version": "7.*"
    }
  }
}
